# ==== The form: wording =======================================================
#
# The fragment's text, anonymised and lightly normalised: the PDF extraction
# scrambled CPL 5(b) and the table cells of GTC 16(c), whose reading order is
# restored. Each leaf is one clause, or one paragraph where the clause is a
# list. A leaf with no stated meaning and no ins:encodingStatus is not yet
# assessed (§18.5): those are the gaps, listed in clause-map.md.

